Build example:
  gcc -O2 -o auth.cgi web_app.c

Use as CGI (e.g., with busybox httpd or Apache). To use a file-based user DB:
  echo "demo:s1:&lt;hash-of-s1+demo123&gt;" &gt; /workspace/users.db
Lines format: username:salt:sha256_hex(salt+password)

Note: This demo uses SHA-256(salt+password) for hashing and a constant-time compare.
Not for production use.
*/"}

